# Clerk writes here in development. In keyless mode — which is what runs when
# the publishable key is missing — it holds a real publishable *and secret* key
# for an auto-provisioned instance, so this is `.env.local` under another name.
# It is also where `detectKeylessEnvDriftAction` drops its telemetry marker.
